OL,4,CArsenal head coach Slegers leaves    W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GArsenal have parted company with     W5
OL,7,Ghead coach Renee Slegers by mutual   W5
OL,8,Gconsent after a disappointing start  W5
OL,9,Gto the season.                       W5
OL,10,                                      W5
